# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# NOTE: _redirects matches on PATH ONLY. Hostname-level rules (e.g. redirecting
# www.sc-sk.com to the apex) do NOT work here and must be configured as a
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule in the dashboard, or by detaching www from the Pages
# project. Do not re-add a www rule to this file; it silently does nothing.
#
# Pages already 308s /foo.html -> /foo automatically, so no rules are needed
# for extension stripping.

# INDEX1.HTML is a retired draft of the homepage that is still deployed.
# Redirect it so it cannot be indexed as near-duplicate homepage content.
/INDEX1.HTML / 301
/index1.html / 301
